WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:06.132
Module 1 follows a simple learning path First we
learn how to represent information

00:00:06.145 --> 00:00:11.513
with variables A variable lets us attach a
meaningful name to a value such as

00:00:11.539 --> 00:00:17.485
sales cost age or temperature Second we learn how
Python

00:00:17.512 --> 00:00:23.067
understands different kinds of values Whole numbers
decimal numbers text and

00:00:23.093 --> 00:00:28.910
true or false values behave differently so data type
matters Third

00:00:29.095 --> 00:00:34.782
we transform values with arithmetic and type
conversion This is where raw values become

00:00:34.808 --> 00:00:40.755
useful metrics such as profit tax growth or margin
Then we learn how to communicate

00:00:40.782 --> 00:00:46.518
those results with print statements and formatted
strings At the end we

00:00:46.544 --> 00:00:51.968
combine these ideas in small business and healthcare
examples The goal is to see one

00:00:51.981 --> 00:00:57.468
repeatable analytical pattern store values transform
them and present the result clearly
